Published build without the test-harness entry points (ADR 003, ADR 016).
The wyd_debug_* functions of wyd_client_entry.cpp are no longer KEEPALIVE
(WYD_DEBUG_EXPORT): EMSCRIPTEN_KEEPALIVE marks the export at compile time and
-sEXPORT_KEEPALIVE=0 does not remove it. The link exports them by name, so the
default (harness) build is unchanged, and --public drops every _wyd_debug_*
name from EXPORTED_FUNCTIONS (UI automation, fake time, camera, item probes).

